            "Withheld employee insurance and personal income tax belong to the worker until remitted: companies credit Account 338 (sub-accounts 3383, 3384, 3386) and Account 3335. These amounts are pass-through obligations, never company costs or revenue. Mandatory employer-side insurance shares are separate expenses omitted from this example.",
