              "vo": "Payday morning. Your phone buzzes on the desk: 15 million dong just landed in checking. You glance at the notification, breathe a sigh of relief, and start mapping out rent and groceries. Most of us picture physical bills leaving the company's bank and dropping into a private box with our name on it. Yet if your employer and you share the same bank, not one dong of physical cash moved across town today. Zero bills changed hands. So tonight, where is your 15 million salary actually sleeping? Over the next few minutes, we follow one paycheck across five players: your company, the payroll bank, you, 500 coworkers, and the lending team upstairs. It starts on your very first morning on the job.",
