      "title": "Scanning a 50K QR for coffee: why does the shop get 100% in 3 seconds, dodging 2.2% card fees?",
      "teaser": "A plastic QR square on a wooden counter, a small speaker announcing 50,000 VND in three seconds, and why pushing your own cash beats pulling from a credit line.",
